    "longDescription": "Railway is the all-in-one intelligent cloud provider. \n\nNow your entire infrastructure is in your pocket, from services to logs, environment variables, metrics, and alerting.\n\nWhether you're at your desk or at your kid’s soccer game, Railway gives you full visibility and control over every service you run. Check deployment status, roll-back a broken release, or inspect resource usage without ever opening a laptop.\n\nRailway supports Hobby, Pro, and Enterprise plans. A free trial with $5 in credits is available for new users.",
